  "description": "Design: docs/design/conditional.md. Decisions: docs/design/DECISIONS.md.\nNote key: C11. Crates: jmap-testjig. Size: S.\n\nImplement docs/design/conditional.md §5.3 and §10 testjig items (decision 1, 2 in docs/design/DECISIONS.md). One shared ScopeGate for all memory backends; call register_\u003cx\u003e_conditional for the 7 registered crates (mail, chat, calendars, tasks, contacts, filenode, sharing); add JMAP_CONDITIONAL_URI with ConditionalCapability {} to the Session and to check_known_capabilities only when dispatcher.conditional_ready(). Acceptance: test asserting conditional_ready() for the jig dispatcher; Session contains the URI; example 5.8 atomic swap over HTTP; atomic: true without the URI in using -\u003e invalidArguments over HTTP; README notes the opt-in.",
